    "Name": "Lindworm LND-A",
    "Details": "The A configuration of the Lindworm OmniProtoMech is a scout built around a Light Active Probe. Because the probe requires it to get very close to detect enemy units, the designers added four machine guns with minimal ammunition, which it can also use to find weak spots. The configuration is not very popular, but it is favored when an objective lies inside a building, where the short range of its machine guns becomes less important.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: OmniProtoMech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.986</color></b>",
